<h2>Table Sort</h2>
<p>Click a column header to sort a table's rows by that column, with automatic string/number/date type detection.</p>

<div class="demo-box" data-controller="table-sort">
  <table>
    <caption>Click a column header to sort by that column.</caption>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th scope="col">
          <button
            type="button"
            data-table-sort-target="header"
            data-action="click->table-sort#sort"
          >
            Name
          </button>
        </th>
        <th scope="col">
          <button
            type="button"
            data-table-sort-target="header"
            data-action="click->table-sort#sort"
          >
            Age
          </button>
        </th>
        <th scope="col">
          <button
            type="button"
            data-table-sort-target="header"
            data-action="click->table-sort#sort"
          >
            Joined
          </button>
        </th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr data-table-sort-target="row">
        <td>Charlie</td>
        <td>40</td>
        <td>2022-03-14</td>
      </tr>
      <tr data-table-sort-target="row">
        <td>Alice</td>
        <td>30</td>
        <td>2024-11-02</td>
      </tr>
      <tr data-table-sort-target="row">
        <td>Bob</td>
        <td>25</td>
        <td>2023-07-19</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<h3>Type override and custom sort value</h3>
<p>
  <code>Batch</code> codes look like dates (<code>M-D-YY</code>) but aren't —
  without an override the browser would misread them as calendar dates and
  sort chronologically. <code>data-table-sort-type="string"</code> on the
  header forces a plain text comparison instead. <code>Released</code> shows
  a month name but sorts by a hidden numeric month number supplied via
  <code>data-table-sort-value</code> on each cell, so it sorts chronologically
  even though the displayed text wouldn't.
</p>

<div class="demo-box" data-controller="table-sort">
  <table>
    <caption>Click a column header to sort by that column.</caption>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th scope="col">
          <button
            type="button"
            data-table-sort-target="header"
            data-action="click->table-sort#sort"
          >
            Item
          </button>
        </th>
        <th scope="col">
          <button
            type="button"
            data-table-sort-target="header"
            data-table-sort-type="string"
            data-action="click->table-sort#sort"
          >
            Batch
          </button>
        </th>
        <th scope="col">
          <button
            type="button"
            data-table-sort-target="header"
            data-action="click->table-sort#sort"
          >
            Released
          </button>
        </th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr data-table-sort-target="row">
        <td>Widget A</td>
        <td>3-15-24</td>
        <td data-table-sort-value="3">March</td>
      </tr>
      <tr data-table-sort-target="row">
        <td>Widget B</td>
        <td>11-2-23</td>
        <td data-table-sort-value="11">November</td>
      </tr>
      <tr data-table-sort-target="row">
        <td>Widget C</td>
        <td>8-9-24</td>
        <td data-table-sort-value="8">August</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
